  "historyNote": "#2017, eff 5-10-82; amd by #2339, eff 4-15-83; amd by #2430, eff 6-30-83; amd by 2545, eff 11-29-83; ss by #3172, eff 1-2-86; ss by #4230, eff 2-23-87; amd by #4425, eff 5-27-88; ss by #4946, eff 10-2-90; amd by #6053, eff 6-24-95; ss by #6634, eff 11-25-97; ss by #8242, eff 12-30-04; ss by #9172, eff 6-6-08; ss by #12033, eff 11-3-16",
